        "HireRight Adjudication Results Summary — showing National Sex Offender Registry 'In Progress, Undefined' and all criminal court records 'Complete - No Court Record Found' (Sheridan, WY) or 'Meets Company Standards'",
        "HireRight Managed Adjudication 3.0 — Status Pending as of May 29, 2026 4:06 PM PDT, with Estimated Completion Date: 03-Jun-2026",
