        "InfoMart Background Check Report, Order No. 15780719 (15 pages, July 7–13, 2026) — SMOKING GUN: Billing Code 'RK LOGISTICS'; Business Unit 'RIS RK Logistics Fremont'; Client Package 'RK Logistics'; Decision Date July 13, 2026; Status 'NEEDS APPROVAL, PER CLIENT CRITERIA.' Criminal searches: Fresno Co. CA — No Record; San Joaquin Co. CA — No Record; Santa Clara Co. CA — No Record; Stanislaus Co. CA — No Record; Clark Co. NV — No Record; New York State — No Record; Sheridan Co. WY — No Record. Federal Criminal: No Record. OFAC: No match. OIG Exclusions: Not found. GSA Procurement: Not found. National Criminal Search / Sex Offender California: RECORD FOUND — 'Subject is a registered Sex Offender in California.' Registry status is confirmed as the sole adverse item.",
