      status: "Pre-complaint — BGC pending 10+ days as of Jul. 17, 2026; Accurate Background running check on Amazon's behalf; adverse action anticipated; sixth PC §290.46(j) matter in portfolio",
      filed: "Pending", judge: "TBD", cluster: 3, type: "State",
      defendants: "Amazon.com Services, LLC (Amazon fulfillment and warehouse operations; principal employer entity for Amazon fulfillment center workers in California); Accurate Background LLC (consumer reporting agency; conducted the background check on Amazon's behalf under shortcode 45996; prior co-defendant with Amazon in Lerma v. Amazon.com Services, LLC et al., No. 8:22-cv-01727 (C.D. Cal.), settled Sept. 2023 — same PC §290.46(j) theory); and DOES 1–10, inclusive",
